data: {"id": "3f56c434f90947d5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1434", "run_id": "3f56c434f90947d5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b` (UID: `1d29ab92-4a47-4587-a367-c4653506d44d`)\n- **Node**: `node2` / Pod IP `172.16.104.28`\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`)\n\n## 已确认事实\n\n### 1. 当前异常仍然存在，未恢复\n- **kubectl_describe** 显示 Pod 状态为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 状态为 `Waiting`，原因 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n- **PromQL 指标** 确认：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason: ImagePullBackOff)，`kube_pod_status_phase` = Pending (1)，Restart Count = 0。\n- ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789352760387, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

